      237.91,
      297.67,
      352.51,
      306.74
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      320.47,
      451.21,
      360.98
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 24 of the Finance Leasing Act, No. 56 of 2000, (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d), and the legal effect of the section as amended is to makeprovisions enabling a lessor to transfer or assign his rights under the lease to any registeredestablishment without the consent of the lessee.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      371.95,
      451.2,
      411.02
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3: This clause amends section 26 of the principal enactment, and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to make provisions to require the lessor to have validly perfected his rightsunder the Secured Transactions Act, No. of 2019 if his rights under the principal enactment are tobe enforced against a trustee in bankruptcy of the lessee or a creditor of the lessee.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      421.87,
      451.2,
      460.94
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4: This clause amends section 27 of the principal enactment, and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to make provisions recognizing the right of a lessor who has registered hisrights under any finance lease under the Secured Transactions Act, No. of 2019, to recoverpossession of an equipment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
